  "description": "Non-comparison sorts and selection over primitive keys: LSD RadixSort for (u)int/(u)long/float/double with key+payload and key+index (argsort) forms, CountingSort for bounded key ranges, and PartialSort quickselect / bounded-heap top-k. Span-based, with caller-supplied-scratch overloads that allocate nothing. Every entry point documents the crossover below which Array.Sort wins. Part of the Celerity family.",
